  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……夏葉、今日のリハーサルは\r\n上手くいかなかったのか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "いいえ、特に問題はなかったわ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……なら、いったい何が引っかかってるんだ？）",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "別に何か失敗したとかじゃなくて\r\n他の子の歌を聞いててわからなくなってしまったのよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "本当に今の歌い方でいいのかって……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（なるほど……確かにさっきから\r\n誰かの真似をするような歌い方をしていたな）",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "select": "夏葉らしいのが一番だ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "select": "誰かの真似を\r\nしなくていい",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "それが夏葉の\r\nやりたいこと？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ただそれを突き詰めていけば\r\nいいんじゃないか？",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私らしさを……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何があっても一生懸命に突っ走れる\r\nそれは誰にでもできることじゃない",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから夏葉はそんな自分らしさを信じて\r\n今まで通りに頑張っていけばいいと俺は思うぞ",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030130,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私は私……\r\n確かに、そうかもしれないわね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030140,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "でも、私らしさを引き出すにはいったいどうしたら……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030150,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "…………そもそも、私って何……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030160,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "有栖川家の……いえ、そうじゃないわ……\r\nこれは……私の、私だけの問題…………",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（夏葉はいつも頑張ってるし、それに見合うだけの自信も\r\n持ってると思っていたが、悩むこともあるんだな……）",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（これからはそういった面も含めて、\r\nちゃんと見守っていくことにしよう）",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありのままでもいいんじゃないか？",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030170,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……でも、何かが違う気がするの",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "けど、何もかも変える必要なんてないんじゃないか？",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030180,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "そう…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030190,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……ねぇ、プロデューサーは私の歌、\r\nどう思ってるのかしら？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "夏葉の歌は――",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030200,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "待って！　やっぱり今のはなし……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……本当にいいのか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030210,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……ええ、いいのよ\r\nそれを聞いちゃうとダメな気がするから",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030220,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "でも、ありがとう、プロデューサー\r\n……私、もう少し自分について考えてみるわ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030220"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自分の目指す形を、思い描いてみてくれ",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030230,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "自分の目指す形……\r\n他のアイドルの真似をしてもそこには辿り着けないわ……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030240,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "じゃあ私は、なんで……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030250,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "別に難しく考える必要はないんだぞ\r\n夏葉はどんなふうに歌いたいんだ？",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030260,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……私は",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001030270,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ダメ、わからないわ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300103/1013001030270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（壁にぶつかったみたいだな……でもこの悩みは\r\n今後のためにもきっと必要なものだ。頑張れよ、夏葉）",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
